persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044142734/", "num_games_owned": 574, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 1380, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1033, "last_played": 1770969997, "avatar": "885c4029fff92a6978617e0b730bcf245df812bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Now this is pure HIGH OCTANE baby! Wooo! Brings me back to the Nuclear Throne days. Soundtrack is phenomenal. Good ♥♥♥♥.", "timestamp_created": 1706732579, "timestamp_updated": 1706732697, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157280438", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041498722", "personaname": "Kronkwich", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kronkwich/", "num_games_owned": 295, "num_reviews": 51, "playtime_forever": 5132, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4826, "last_played": 1706836566, "avatar": "398dffc8c2db5a73ae7afbe4c7785de1c240e1be"}, "language": "english", "review": "Roboquest perfectly blends movement-based FPS game and roguelite elements to create a very fun experience with tons of replayability. Game feels polished and feature-complete, but even more content is being added in the next year. Would recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1706731066, "timestamp_updated": 1706731066, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157270712", "author": {"steamid": "76561197979874029", "personaname": "//// Batpiss", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Batpissed/", "num_games_owned": 211, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 7122, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2002, "last_played": 1783064009, "avatar": "f132e69ba268cd9710a388610fff1e8c6cf13a01"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is without a doubt my favorite FPS of last year! Movement is sweet as butter and every robot downed is as satisfying as the next. Would wholeheartedly recommend the game if it's even in your line of sight. See you soon, Brobots.", "timestamp_created": 1706720869, "timestamp_updated": 1706720869, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480769246816635132", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157268765", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086083759", "personaname": "Абракадабра", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Abracadabrah/", "num_games_owned": 382, "num_reviews": 66, "playtime_forever": 302, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 185, "last_played": 1709103351, "avatar": "02824a7f6e98b080c3dafb134741aa49609895c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Да!!!", "timestamp_created": 1706718951, "timestamp_updated": 1706718951, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157260323", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009941463", "personaname": "Sploinke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Sploinke/", "num_games_owned": 903, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 539, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 108, "last_played": 1748212336, "avatar": "ff4b6c9b3aa0bb00f6f74468edc5115e9c6fdd52"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1706710800, "timestamp_updated": 1706710800, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157254847", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067652169", "personaname": "Cefixim", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198067652169/", "num_games_owned": 340, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3761, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1104, "last_played": 1743937240, "avatar": "8461fcee589d2e1029b0a54c95caa8a0edf812f8"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best games I have ever played.\n\n18h in, I have maybe seen half of the content available and I am just enjoying my time. I haven't even played all the characters and not found all the weapons yet. There is just so many possibilities.\n\nIt is a RogueLite, so you will be stronger with every run and additionally there are many subgoals apart from beating the final boss. I have actually never seen the final boss yet but still enjoy the progession so far.\nMany different (permanent) upgrades to find and collect, mini-missions to accomplish and things to unlock. It is great!\n\nYour whole body is pumped with serotonine and adrenaline while playing this, as its just that fast with a great loot system and visually impressive combat.\n\nYour runs tend to get quicker and quicker so the \"hard\" levels turn into easy ones that you rush through at a certain point. Therefor you dont spend too much time in one run and dont feel too sad when losing one.\n\nJust test it for yourself and get hooked.\n\nThanks to the devs for this great game. The roadmap is very promising! :)", "timestamp_created": 1706704900, "timestamp_updated": 1706704900, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157242230", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961718482", "personaname": "Fisty", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961718482/", "num_games_owned": 446, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 5852, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1821, "last_played": 1759257910, "avatar": "89e0e989d556d6d405e1fbcadb0eef700720e1f8"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game has a great core and clearly a lot of love has been put into much of it.", "timestamp_created": 1706686666, "timestamp_updated": 1708876298, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.454545468091964722", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157241417", "author": {"steamid": "76561198207908915", "personaname": "nnnnn", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198207908915/", "num_games_owned": 1171, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 591, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 591, "last_played": 1706452911, "avatar": "66c20a9c756c445a1e678a6be48071eab5cf5a78"}, "language": "english", "review": "The music, graphics, gameplay are all great!  But why do I have to start from scratch every time I die!", "timestamp_created": 1706685371, "timestamp_updated": 1706685371, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny":