"app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157238544", "author": {"steamid": "76561198148453736", "personaname": "Douglemagne", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198148453736/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 5795, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1369, "last_played": 1731455401, "avatar": "0b2febdead253dbeed26c68930af541034d003d8"}, "language": "english", "review": "You have to customize them a bit, but the controls for this game are top notch and it's a blast to play.", "timestamp_created": 1706680550, "timestamp_updated": 1706680550, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157236637", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079346795", "personaname": "s0mel", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Supway/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 2125, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1194, "last_played": 1727352491, "avatar": "ed5a0e2f4d3b1507dc46e9fdf7a3d6a409f4b0d2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Roboquest is a fantastic action roguelite with impressive design on all fronts\nVery fun 8/10\nMy only gripes are: \n 1. you cant save mid run, with runs lasting between 30-40 minuets, I find myself abandoning decent runs\n 2. although the upgrades work well in context to the game, I found them relatively bland and don't change much other \n     than your damage output and healing ability\n\nPrice point is a little steep imo, wait for a good sale", "timestamp_created": 1706677570, "timestamp_updated": 1706677570, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157234517", "author": {"steamid": "76561198126301427", "personaname": "ANUSTART", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198126301427/", "num_games_owned": 439, "num_reviews": 108, "playtime_forever": 434, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 397, "last_played": 1736393120, "avatar": "69d940dbecbc34a7443cc313995b04f75699e36a"}, "language": "english", "review": "epic", "timestamp_created": 1706674466, "timestamp_updated": 1706674466, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157226805", "author": {"steamid": "76561198076876860", "personaname": "iDango", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/moltonlava12/", "num_games_owned": 396, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1782, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1239, "last_played": 1733781453, "avatar": "a324d5e90a0a6d5e7d9f1ae34fce7c7731a2c773"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game feels so good to play. Great roguelike with a somewhat lighthearted style!", "timestamp_created": 1706664009, "timestamp_updated": 1706664009, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157226219", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037835564", "personaname": "Canjuju", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198037835564/", "num_games_owned": 391, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 3832, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3054, "last_played": 1719788629, "avatar": "235e6e10cd66af9a6c42020f8053cf3a32508522"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun", "timestamp_created": 1706663141, "timestamp_updated": 1706663141, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157225523", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995436735", "personaname": "Eye of the Beholder", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995436735/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 220, "playtime_forever": 1293, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1293, "last_played": 1703937682, "avatar": "fbb7f96a3d40865edfd77243524543bf62214d7d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun for a little bit then loses steam.  Wish it was more engaging or unlocked more story after beating it several times to give you a reason to play.  Weapon upgrades + other classes doesn't do it for me.  I regret this purchase.", "timestamp_created": 1706662204, "timestamp_updated": 1706662204, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.353861451148986816", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157225004", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039565357", "personaname": "ARCTICWOLF", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039565357/", "num_games_owned": 477, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 10233, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4041, "last_played": 1775176646, "avatar": "34966e89066b62abe376472f73605b35d8bc1ec1"}, "language": "english", "review": "A few weeks ago I wouldn't have recommended this game, but here we are 60 hours later. Don't let the style fool you, this game is challenging. Even on normal you will die even with very powerful perks. My biggest criticism of this game is that the classes don't feel all that different from one another. They all have completely different abilities, but often I find myself implementing exactly the same strategy across classes to great success.", "timestamp_created": 1706661493, "timestamp_updated": 1706661493, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157222166", "author": {"steamid": "76561198274743237", "personaname": "Diamond", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198274743237/", "num_games_owned": 277, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 1964, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1328, "last_played": 1736202093, "avatar": "05ad5c88c5451551ab3678ad159f6c25ea305404"}, "language": "english", "review": "A friend and I picked this one up together, and have been having a great time with this title! It's has a lot of neat weapons and  plenty of build variety, and several characters which offer a lot of variety to your approach each run. There are a few small quests and gadgets you pick up across several runs which massively expand your mobility options and eventually build up to make you incredibly powerful. This may be the root of my only real complaint though.\n\nIt's a pretty minor one, which not everyone will take issue with, but early on this game is pretty difficult, and it feels nice to work your way up to the finish on the harder difficulties after building up your arsenal through upgrades, but I felt like my character got a little too powerful too fast. Once you unlock most of the upgrades available, the game becomes significantly easier, the new difficulties felt trivial nearly as soon as we unlocked them. \n\nI think I would have preferred if it either toned down the upgrades and mobility gadgets a bit (by the end game you can basically keep yourself airborne for however long you please.) or made the extra difficulty's scaling harsher. However I maintain that this is a very minor complaint for an otherwise very fun game, I definitely recommend picking it up!", "timestamp_created": 1706657449, "timestamp_updated": 1706657449, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157221586", "author": {"steamid": "76561198310401103", "personaname": "Succubus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/_-_Succubus_-_/", "num_games_owned": 112, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5331, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1872, "last_played": 1767442258, "avatar": "19a466b1968c7b722b0d676c5c38f836876d0424"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game yes", "timestamp_created": 1706656726, "timestamp_updated": 1706656726, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157216057", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023535139", "personaname": "4RM3D", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/4RM3D/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 3568, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 802, "last_played": 1710104161, "avatar": "0c460ad595622bd72d0fcce37ca0f6e49cb497ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "Update: it seems the latest patch has fixed the connection issues. Considering my criticism has been solved, I'll change my review to a thumbs up.\n\n[strike]Co-op is unplayable because disconnects happen almost every run. But the worst part, and why I give it a thumbs down, is that there is no reconnect feature. This is a basic thing for co-op games to have. That's why it's unforgivable.[/strike]", "timestamp_created": 1706649812, "timestamp_updated": 1709075460, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.507168948650360107", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 14, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "157215642", "author": {"steamid": "76561199276072810", "personaname": "gymrat_405", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/rubbingit/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 2738, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 520, "last_played": 1761952640, "avatar": "eafbb5eadcafa534a714f8006b25a1e7d32bd091"}, "language": "english", "review": "fast", "timestamp_created": 1706649394, "timestamp_updated": 1706649394, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_releas